OCWORLD 1
NAME RallyDash
GAMEMODE AN_RallyRules
DEFAULTPAWN AN_RallyDriver
SPAWN 9664.27 3396.24 150 149.7
SUN elev 33.0 azim 215.0 color 1 0.96 0.88 lux 95000
SKY model physical
FOG exp density 0.000012 color 0.72 0.80 0.90
POSTVOLUME infinite saturation 1.1 vignette 0.25
# RallyDash: a lap game made only of content (make_rally_dash.py writes this file; edit the script, not the file). Centimetres, +X forward at yaw 0,
# +Y right, +Z up. Every static shape is the built-in unit cube or sphere (half-extent 1 cm, so the last three numbers of a PLACEG are half extents).
# The loop is 654 m round, 3 laps; 8 checkpoints (gate 0 is the start/finish line); traffic follows RallyDash.oclanes on the right.
# Ground: top at z = 0. A ring of rocks hides where it ends.
PLACEG Meshes/cube.ocmesh 0 0 -50 0 0 0 20000 20000 50 M_RallyGrass name Ground
